# Build context for the Linux acceptance image.
#
# The image only needs the crate sources: keeping .git/ (full history),
# target/ (gigabytes of build output) and local artifacts out of the context
# avoids shipping them in the image and stops unrelated changes from
# invalidating the expensive apt/toolchain layers.
.git/
.github/
target/
dist/
*.tar.gz
*.app/
acceptance-evidence/
freewheeling-diagnostic-*/
.cargo/registry/
# Local agent/tool state, which is git-ignored and may hold credentials.
.reasonix/
*.create_token
.env*
# Editor and OS files are never part of the image.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
